<tr> 
<td width="100%" valign="top" align="left" style="text-align: left; font-family: Chivo, Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; color: #223341; font-size: 30px; font-weight: bold; letter-spacing: normal; line-height: 32px; padding-bottom: 20px; width: 100%;"> <p style="text-align: center; margin: 0px;"><span style="color: #0f476b;">Simplify Premium Billing</span></p> <p style="text-align: center; margin: 0px;"><span style="color: #0f476b;">The Flywire Way</span></p> </td> 
</tr> 
<tr> 
<td width="100%" valign="top" align="left" class="aligned-bullets" style="text-align: left; font-family: Chivo, Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; color: #223341; font-size: 16px; font-weight: normal; letter-spacing: normal; line-height: 24px; padding-bottom: 40px; width: 100%;"> <p style="margin: 0px;"><span style="color: #0f476b;">Premium billing and collections don’t have to be stressful—even when you’re managing global customers, multiple currencies, and complex policy structures.</span></p> <p style="margin: 0px;">‌<br /></p> <p style="margin: 0px;"><span style="color: #0f476b;">That’s where Flywire steps in.</span></p> <p style="margin: 0px;">‌<br /></p> <p style="margin: 0px;"><span style="color: #0f476b;">Designed for insurers, Flywire helps you get paid faster, reduce admin hassles, and deliver a seamless payment experience for brokers and policyholders worldwide.</span></p> <p style="margin: 0px;">‌<br /></p> <p style="margin: 0px;"><span style="color: #0f476b;"><strong>News You Can Use:</strong> With global insurance markets tightening and regulatory requirements evolving, insurers that streamline billing processes now are better positioned to improve cash flow and maintain customer trust. </span></p> <p style="margin: 0px;">‌<br /></p> <p style="margin: 0px;"><span style="color: #0f476b;">Flywire makes it easier to stay ahead.</span></p> </td> 
</tr> 
